---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Apply · Careers · Perfect Pavers of Palm Beach"
  description="Apply to join Perfect Pavers of Palm Beach. Fill out our quick job application and a real person on our team will get back to you.">

  <nav class="crumbs">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a href="/">Home</a> <span>/</span> <a href="/about/why-choose-us/">About</a> <span>/</span> <a href="/careers/">Careers</a> <span>/</span> <strong>Apply</strong>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <section class="apply-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--brass)">Job application</div>
      <h1>Apply to join <em>the team.</em></h1>
      <p class="lede" id="apply-for">Fill out the short form below and a real person on our team will get back to you. A resume is welcome but not required.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block wrap apply-wrap">
    <div class="form-card">
      <iframe
        src="https://api.leadconnectorhq.com/widget/form/NNjDcRBy4UWDjR4CwVUe"
        style="width:100%;min-height:1181px;border:none;border-radius:8px"
        id="inline-NNjDcRBy4UWDjR4CwVUe"
        data-layout="{'id':'INLINE'}"
        data-trigger-type="alwaysShow"
        data-trigger-value=""
        data-activation-type="alwaysActivated"
        data-activation-value=""
        data-deactivation-type="neverDeactivate"
        data-deactivation-value=""
        data-form-name="Job Application"
        data-height="1181"
        data-layout-iframe-id="inline-NNjDcRBy4UWDjR4CwVUe"
        data-form-id="NNjDcRBy4UWDjR4CwVUe"
        title="Job Application">
      </iframe>
    </div>
    <p class="apply-alt">Prefer email? Write to <a href="mailto:office@perfectpavers.com?subject=Careers%20%E2%80%94%20Application">office@perfectpavers.com</a> or call <a href="tel:+15618348880">(561) 834-8880</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="block wrap" style="max-width:760px;padding-top:0">
    <h2>What happens after you apply</h2>
    <p>A real person on our team reviews every application — not an automated screen. If your background looks like a fit, we reach out within a few business days to set up a short call, learn what you are looking for, and walk you through the role, the pay and the day-to-day. There is no long, drawn-out process and no ghosting; if it is not the right match, we tell you.</p>
    <h2>Who we hire</h2>
    <p>We build premium paver driveways, patios, pool decks and outdoor living spaces across Palm Beach County, and we are usually looking for people in the field and in sales: installers and crew leads who take pride in a clean, level, lasting job, and in-home sales consultants who can walk a property, listen to a homeowner and quote honest work. Experience in hardscape, construction or home-improvement sales is a plus, but character, reliability and a good attitude matter more. If you do great work and treat people right, we want to hear from you.</p>
    <p>Perfect Pavers is an equal-opportunity employer. We consider every qualified applicant regardless of background.</p>

    <h2>The work you would be part of</h2>
    <p>Every day our crews build hardscape that lasts across Palm Beach County — from <a href="/services/driveways/">paver driveways</a> and <a href="/services/walkways/">walkways</a> to <a href="/services/pool-decks/">pool decks</a>, <a href="/services/patios/">patios</a> and full <a href="/services/outdoor-living/">outdoor living spaces</a>. If you want to understand the standard we hold and the way we treat homeowners before you apply, read <a href="/about/why-choose-us/">why homeowners choose Perfect Pavers</a> and see the range of <a href="/service-areas/">communities we serve</a>. New team members tell us the two things that surprised them most were how carefully the base is built on every job and how straight we are with both customers and crew — no cut corners, no games. If that is how you already like to work, you will fit right in here.</p>
  </section>

  <script is:inline src="https://link.msgsndr.com/js/form_embed.js"></script>
  <script is:inline>
    (function () {
      var titles = {
        'field-sales-assistant': 'Field Sales Assistant',
        'in-home-sales-consultant': 'In-Home Sales Consultant',
      };
      try {
        var role = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search).get('role');
        if (role && titles[role]) {
          var el = document.getElementById('apply-for');
          if (el) el.innerHTML = 'You’re applying for <strong>' + titles[role] + '</strong>. Fill out the short form below and a real person on our team will get back to you.';
        }
      } catch (e) {}
    })();
  </script>

  <style>
    .crumbs{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--ivory)}
    .crumbs .wrap{padding-top:16px;padding-bottom:16px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
    .crumbs a:hover{color:var(--brass-dark)}
    .crumbs span{margin:0 8px;color:var(--brass)}
    .crumbs strong{font-weight:500;color:var(--ink)}

    .apply-hero{background:var(--green);color:var(--ivory);padding:70px 0 58px}
    .apply-hero h1{font-size:clamp(38px,6.5vw,58px);color:var(--ivory);margin-top:14px}
    .apply-hero h1 em{font-style:italic;color:var(--brass)}
    .apply-hero .lede{font-weight:300;opacity:.9;max-width:44em;margin-top:18px;font-size:18px}
    .apply-hero .lede :global(strong){color:var(--ivory);font-weight:500}

    .form-card{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--ivory);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:16px}
    .apply-alt{max-width:760px;margin:22px auto 0;text-align:center;font-size:15px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:300}
    .apply-alt a{color:var(--brass-dark);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px}
    .apply-alt a:hover{color:var(--green)}

    @media(max-width:1024px){ .apply-hero{padding:52px 0 44px} }
    @media(max-width:600px){ .apply-hero{padding:44px 0 36px} .form-card{padding:10px} }
  </style>

</BaseLayout>
